' timing: CommandClock, CommandBinary, CommandAnalog, CommandTicks, CommandPixelHeight
@startuml
clock "Clock_0" as C0 with period 50
clock "Clock_1" as C1 with period 50 pulse 15 offset 10
binary "Enable" as EN
analog "Voltage" between 0 and 5 as V
V ticks num on multiple 1
V is 200 pixels height
C0 ticks every 2

@0
EN is low
V is 0

@C0*2
EN is high
V is 4.5
@enduml
